sequenceDiagram
  actor Coach
  participant UI as Web client
  participant API as Backend API
  participant KPI as KPI engine
  participant REC as Recommendation engine
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Coach->>UI: Open player profile
  UI->>API: GET /players/{id}/recommendations
  API->>DB: Load player context, results, sessions
  API->>KPI: Compute KPIs, z-scores, trends
  KPI-->>API: KPI values
  API->>REC: Evaluate active rule set on KPI values
  REC-->>API: Recommendations + rule id, inputs, rationale
  API->>DB: Store recommendations (rule-set version)
  API-->>UI: Recommendations with explanations
  Coach->>UI: Accept / modify / reject
  UI->>API: POST /recommendations/{id}/decision
  API->>DB: Store decision
